{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In Sector 404</strong>, you play as a man returning home late at night. The block is quiet\u2014too quiet. You take your medicine like always, but something\u2019s wrong. The stairwell feels endless, the air feels heavy and unseen eyes seem to follow your every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0You need to get home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0But the building has other plans.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Starting at the ground floor, your goal is simple: reach your apartment on the tenth. But the floors hide <strong>anomalies</strong>\u2014distortions in sound, space, or logic. Miss them, and you\u2019re <strong>pulled back</strong> to the start. <strong>Again</strong>. And <strong>again</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must watch <strong>every</strong> shadow, listen to <strong>every</strong> sound, and <strong>notice</strong> the smallest things\u2014because <strong>missing</strong> even one detail could mean you <strong>never</strong> make it home.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With over <strong>70 unique anomalies</strong> scattered throughout the block, no two games are ever the same. Stay sharp\u2014your survival depends on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re not sure what\u2019s worse\u2014the things you\u2019re seeing, or the feeling that you\u2019ve seen them before. What if you\u2019ve already made it home\u2014and this is what it looks like now?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3431930?t=1749377556","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3431930?t=1749377556","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431930/57bf64bc0b72eabc0dd284364590e147dc50128c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749377556","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431930/57bf64bc0b72eabc0dd284364590e147dc50128c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749377556","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In Sector 404</strong>, you play as a man returning home late at night. The block is quiet\u2014too quiet. You take your medicine like always, but something\u2019s wrong. The stairwell feels endless, the air feels heavy and unseen eyes seem to follow your every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0You need to get home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0But the building has other plans.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Starting at the ground floor, your goal is simple: reach your apartment on the tenth. But the floors hide <strong>anomalies</strong>\u2014distortions in sound, space, or logic. Miss them, and you\u2019re <strong>pulled back</strong> to the start. <strong>Again</strong>. And <strong>again</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must watch <strong>every</strong> shadow, listen to <strong>every</strong> sound, and <strong>notice</strong> the smallest things\u2014because <strong>missing</strong> even one detail could mean you <strong>never</strong> make it home.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With over <strong>70 unique anomalies</strong> scattered throughout the block, no two games are ever the same. Stay sharp\u2014your survival depends on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re not sure what\u2019s worse\u2014the things you\u2019re seeing, or the feeling that you\u2019ve seen them before. What if you\u2019ve already made it home\u2014and this is what it looks like now?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","developers":["Empty Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431930/b05d2b8a3bf2451768f640654e94449d915875c5/header.jpg?t=1749377556","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257085522,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085522/movie480.mp4?t=1749287037","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085522/movie_max.mp4?t=1749287037"},"name":"Sector 404 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257085522/07d9f53db581ad5ee20522e1b28543906d52532c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749287037","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085522/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749287037","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085522/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749287037"}}],"name":"Sector 404","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-4590 3.3GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Empty Studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nMedo","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Horror","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming so